cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'If you use BarelySig in your research, please cite it as below.'
type: software
title: 'BarelySig'
abstract: "Free, open-source statistics and graphing for wet-lab scientists, in the browser. Column, Grouped, Nested, Contingency and XY tables with paste from spreadsheets; t tests, nonparametric tests, one- and two-way (including repeated-measures and nested) ANOVA with multiple comparisons, chi-square and Fisher's exact tests, linear and nonlinear regression, correlation and growth curves, computed by R (WebR) and validated against desktop R; bar, dot, box, violin, SuperPlot and grouped bar graphs with significance brackets, exported as SVG or PNG at journal sizes with a reproducible recipe. All computation is client-side."
authors:
  - family-names: Usaj
    given-names: Matej
    email: m.usaj@utoronto.ca
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0675-2847'
    affiliation: 'The Donnelly Centre, University of Toronto'
license: MIT
